Invitation to {{{org_name}}} accepted
<!---------------->
{{> email/email_header }}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;color:#011936">This email is to notify you that {{email}} has accepted your invitation to join <b>{{org_name}}</b>.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;color:#011936">Please <a href="{{url}}/" style="color:#c50d33">log in</a> to the Rebase Password Manager and confirm them from the organization management page.</p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#011936">If you do not wish to confirm this user, you can also remove them from the organization on the same page.</p>
{{> email/email_footer }}
